# Cài extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) trong VS Code, chạy server rồi bấm "Send Request".
@base = http://localhost:3000

### index
GET {{base}}/books

### create (JSON)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Clean Code", "author": "Robert C. Martin" }

### create (HTML form)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Clean Code&author=Robert C. Martin

### PUT trên cả collection -> 403
PUT {{base}}/books

### DELETE all
DELETE {{base}}/books

### new form (phải KHÔNG bị hiểu là id = "new")
GET {{base}}/books/new

### edit form
GET {{base}}/books/7/edit

### show
GET {{base}}/books/42

### POST trên 1 phần tử -> 403
POST {{base}}/books/42

### update
PUT {{base}}/books/42
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Clean Code", "author": "Robert C. Martin" }

### destroy
DELETE {{base}}/books/42
